The resistivity sequence follows a QH-type curve. The first group of three layers shows a continuous decrease in resistivity (Q), while the second group (layers 2-3-4) shows a decrease followed by an increase (H). Please note that the existing file classification of HA-type is incorrect and does not align with the interpreted layer values.

