According to the vertical electrical sounding (VES) notation rules, the first group of three layers (2792.1 > 1847.0 < 2743.7) follows an H-type pattern, while the second group (1847.0 < 2743.7 > 1318.3) follows a K-type pattern. This results in an HK-type curve. The calculated curve type matches the HK-type classification currently recorded on file for this station.

